     "date": "2026-08-16T08:17:56Z"
    },
    "message": "feat(desktop): system tray app with config persistence + startup-at-login\n\nAdds a native system-tray app (pystray) that controls the MCC server as a child\nprocess, with a persisted ~/.fcc/desktop.json and optional startup-at-login.\n\n- Tray menu: Open Admin / Check Server Status / Restart Server / Start at Login\n  (toggle) / Tray Enabled (toggle) / Quit.\n- config/desktop.py: DesktopState + atomic persistence (never raises on\n  corrupt/missing), and OS autostart helpers (Windows HKCU Run key via winreg,\n  macOS LaunchAgent plist, Linux ~/.config/autostart .desktop).\n- cli/desktop.py: DesktopController spawns mcc-server as a child (no in-process\n  supervisor) and drives it over the loopback admin API; honors server_auto_start.\n- cli/desktop_tray.py + desktop_entrypoint.py + desktop_assets.py: pystray\n  adapter, argv flags (--start-at-login/--no-start-at-login/--tray-enabled/\n  --no-tray-enabled/--status/--export-icon), and a swappable placeholder \"MC\"\n  icon (user logo will replace assets/app-icon.png later).\n- core/interprocess_lock.py: cross-platform advisory singleton lock.\n- Admin: GET/POST /admin/api/desktop (loopback, persist-only) + a minimal\n  \"Desktop\" card on the dashboard.\n- pyproject: pystray dep (win32/darwin-gated) + [project.gui-scripts] mcc-desktop\n  / fcc-desktop.\n\nVerification: full suite 3996 passed / 6 pre-existing PS-installer failures\n(baseline unchanged); ruff format/check + ty clean. Skills /ui-ux-pro-max:ui-ux-pro-max\nand /ui-ux-pro-max:brand invoked for the tray menu + dashboard card.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
