    "message": "fix(desktop): correct autostart command + winreg ty on Linux CI\n\n- _autostart_command now runs `python -m my_claude_code.cli.desktop_entrypoint`\n  (a single consistent form) instead of the broken `mcc-desktop -m module`.\n- The three per-OS autostart tests assert the entrypoint module, not the shim name.\n- Add winreg to ty allowed-unresolved-imports (it is Windows-only; Linux CI cannot\n  resolve its members).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
