    "message": "fix(desktop): guard winreg import at module level for Linux CI ty\n\nMove `import winreg` from function body to module level under\n`if sys.platform == \"win32\":`, mirroring interprocess_lock.py's `msvcrt` guard.\nty on Linux resolves winreg's members as unresolved when imported lazily; the\nplatform guard matches the existing pattern and lets CI pass. Also format the\ndesktop test file.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
